## Sky

::bg{location="outside" time="dawn"}
::music{playback="start" mood="triumph" volume="up"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: Grass. Real grass, wet, cold, and the sky is enormous and does not care about her at all. It is the best thing she has ever seen.
@narrator{code="0020" when="run.carriesFeather"}: The grey feather slips out of her collar and goes up, and up, and does not come down.
@narrator{code="0030" when="user.ashfallOn"}: By the door outside, one grey lily has come up through the grass. She takes it for Maud.
::set{season.ashfall.lilies += 1 when="user.ashfallOn"}
@wren{code="0010" mono}: Maud's going to be insufferable.
